      "Alongside LSIP, Mubadala Bio plans to establish a commercial research and development laboratory on Khalifa University’s main campus, within its College of Medicine and Health Sciences. The proposed facility will enable academic researchers and students to engage in research and development on advanced medicines and healthcare technologies.",
      "The agreement was signed during a ceremony at the summit by Dr. Bakheet Al Katheeri, Chief Executive Officer of Mubadala’s UAE Investments Platform and Chairman of Mubadala Bio; H.E. Professor Ebrahim Al Hajri, President of Khalifa University of Science and Technology; and H.E. Amal Al Jaberi, Chief Executive Officer of Khalifa University Enterprises Company.",
